  "body": "## What changed\n\n- Added the `set_stock_material { \"material\": string | null }` row to Section 4 of `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`.\n- Updated the `add_tool` row in Section 4 to document the `cutting_data` `\"material\": \"unknown\"` and optional `stepdown` / `stepover` (mm) fields for `add_tool` and `edit_tool` definitions, plus validation refusals.\n- Recorded the design choices in `docs/decisions/2076-set-stock-material-skill.md`.\n\n## Merge dependency\n\nChecked against upstream/main `3e47b898b0148727979ff4a509f33a742f80ff1d`. Main already contains implementation commit `75031d5f9b5e6f9d2f297108ff51e3c0d0c5c3fb`. It registers `set_stock_material` in `crates/app/src/mcp/cutting_tools.rs`. Its `add_tool` schema documents `unknown`, `stepdown`, and `stepover` in `crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs`. The cutting-data DTO parses those fields.\n\nThere is no remaining implementation dependency on PR #2077, although that PR remains open. The skill rows now describe the implemented inputs. The pending restrictions are removed. This PR remains a draft for re-review.\n\n## Cause\n\nImplementation commit `75031d5f9b5e6f9d2f297108ff51e3c0d0c5c3fb` (#2015, also in PR #2077) adds `set_stock_material` and `cutting_data` support for `\"material\": \"unknown\"` and optional `stepdown` / `stepover` (mm), and `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md` lacked documentation for those MCP inputs.\n\n## Tests\n\n- Documentation pins and mutation checks cover both skill rows, the decision record, and the implementation dependency in this body.\n- Gate and diff checks are reported in the review-fix comment.\n- Clippy does not apply because no Rust crate changed.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone (`git diff --stat upstream/main -- '*.nc' '*.cl'` is empty).\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- `cargo clippy` did not run because zero Rust crates changed.\n- Live MCP calls were not executed in this docs-only PR; Main contains the implementation and Rust tests for `set_stock_material` and `cutting_data`.\n\n## Overlaps\n\n- PR #1738, PR #1817, PR #2037, and PR #2083 modify `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md` in other sections or rows (workflow diagram, `set_wcs_flip`, `edit_operation`, `add_accessory`, `set_accessory`): touches the same file, different function; whichever merges second refreshes.\n- PR #2077 (#2015) contains implementation already present on main and names #2076 as its skill follow-up; it does not touch `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`.\n\nProcess change: yes\nEffort: low\nChangelog: none\nFixes #2076\n\n",
